# ==============================================================
# Unreal Engine 5 — .gitignore
# Project: VoidUnreal  (8번 과제 제출 = NBC_JangSik_Assignment8)
# ==============================================================

# --- Build / intermediate ---
Binaries/
Build/
DerivedDataCache/
Intermediate/
Saved/

# --- Generated solution / project files (각 머신에서 재생성) ---
*.sln
*.suo
*.sdf
*.opensdf
*.pdb
*.xcodeproj
*.xcworkspace

# --- IDE artifacts ---
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.DotSettings.user
*.uproject.DotSettings.user
*.user
*.uplugin.user

# --- OS / misc ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- UE5 local collections ---
Content/Collections/
Content/Developers/

# --- Marketplace asset packs (TPS 피벗 후 미사용, 로컬만 보관) ---
# 필요 시 각 개발자가 FAB에서 개별 다운로드. GitHub 100MB 제한 회피.
Content/Fantastic_Dungeon_Pack/
Content/MPTopdownKit/

# --- Large binaries that shouldn't be in Git (consider Git LFS) ---
# *.uasset 과 *.umap 은 기본적으로 포함 — Content/ 는 커밋 필요
# 다만 프로젝트가 수 GB 이상으로 커지면 LFS 도입 고려
